OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA much brighter day with some
OL,6,Fsunny intervals. There will also be a
OL,7,Ffew light passing showers. Fresh to
OL,8,Fstrong southwesterly winds veering
OL,9,Fwesterly later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRather cloudy in Shetland
OL,12,Fthis evening and overnight, with
OL,13,Fscattered showers. Orkney will be
OL,14,Fdrier, with clear spells and just the
OL,15,Fodd passing shower. Fresh to strong
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FA bright and breezy day with
OL,19,Fsunny intervals and a few passing
OL,20,Flight showers. Winds easing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
